        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "If you want your eyes infected, this is the perfect place.\n\nI’ve been doing lashes for over a year and decided to give it a try at Jos Esthetician, my eyes started to feel very uncomfortable and today told her to remove them as soon as possible, which she did and left some glue onto my lids. Over the night it started to feel very uncomfortable. Next day called her many times so that she can remove the glue, she never replied and I had to just go to her place. She said she removed the glue for the second time and the glue was still there. My eyes reacted really bad later on because she just couldn’t remove the glue from eyes properly. She just completely ignored me and wouldn’t pick up call or answer my text message. She didn’t even Try to help me out. Not professionally.",
        "time": 1724196564,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Veerpal Kaur",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110566911625115657088/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWNqYxhjrC_JZi7bXbMbSzHYYGkUyCQikOegsmEpRKlKheEfFvw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I did lash extensions done here, and the results were disastrous. I ended up with an infection and swollen eyes. The salon was completely unresponsive to my attempts to reach out. Highly unprofessional—avoid this place! Please",
        "time": 1724249637,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "B B",
